8.1 Health & Wellness Claims: Any assertion that a product treats, cures, prevents, or alleviates a specific medical condition (including but not limited to arthritis, diabetes, hypertension, or pain) is classified as a health claim. This applies to all languages and formats, including image alt-text, hidden metadata, and secondary language variants. Non-medical devices cannot make health claims regardless of 'wellness' framing.
